@diegorusso I agree with your suggestion to add sanitizer coverage for the JIT in the CI runners.

@sergey-miryanov I also agree with your point. To add, modern compilers handle memcpy very well and can optimize these patterns efficiently.

Update: I'm currently running tests on AArch64 via QEMU emulation, and preliminary results show no alignment issues.

